<title>PHILIPPINES: San Miguel opens Hong Kong brewery.</title>
<headline>San Miguel opens Hong Kong brewery.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine beer and food conglomerate San Miguel Corp said on Monday it had opened its new Yuen long brewery in Hong Kong late last week.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the new brewery, which cost over $1 billion, was one of the most technologically advanced breweries in the world.</p>
<p>The project, which is being undertaken by San Miguel Brewery Hong Kong Ltd, can produce over one million hectolitres of beer yearly.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
